    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n6 Bridgewater Hall is a wonderfully presented two-bedroom apartment ideally located in the heart of the City Centre. This apartment benefits from a sunny south facing aspect with every conceivable amenities within close proximity.\n\nThe accommodations of no.6 briefly comprises; a warm and welcoming entrance hall with access to a generous storage room, the open plan living/dining room is flooded with natural light thanks to the apartments south facing aspect, with the well-appointed kitchen positioned to the rear. There are two generously sized double bedroom, with the modern style family bathroom completing the accommodations. \n\nThe apartment enjoys an exceptionally convenient location on the doorstep of Dublin City Centre and all its amenities. Fairview Park and the Clontarf seafront are both within easy reach, while the IFSC, East Point Business Park and Grand Canal Dock are just a short commute away. An excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, parks, schools and colleges can be found within walking distance. The area is exceptionally well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes nearby and Connolly Station, providing both Rail and Luas services, within a short stroll. The M1 is easily accessed via the Port Tunnel, offering seamless connectivity to Dublin Airport, the M50 and destinations further afield."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.265m x 3.957m\nWarm and welcoming entrance hall providing access to hot press & storage, featuring laminate wood flooring.\n\nLiving/ Dining Room - 4.065m x 3.797m\nSpacious south facing open plan living/dining room with laminate wood flooring, floor to ceiling windows flooding the room with natural light, Juliet balcony and the well-appointed kitchen positioned to the rear.\n\nKitchen - 1.572m x 4.499m\nWell-appointed kitchen featuring ample storage in the floor and wall mounted cupboards, tiled flooring & splashback, oven & four ring hob, dishwasher, washer dryer, microwave and fridge-freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.429m x 3.714m\nGenerously sized master bedroom with laminate wood flooring, picture window and built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.310m x 2.556m\nEqually spacious second double bedroom with laminate wood flooring, picture window and built in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom - 2.626m x 1.810m\nModern style fully tiled family bathroom featuring wc, whb, wall mounted mirror with integrated lighting, and shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
